{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":41,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"442c803c-2ffa-42fb-87d6-5cd026c101bc","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561212907,"PostDateInt":1769171816000,"PostDate":"2026-01-23T20:36:56","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"数字芯片设计工程师(J12386)","OrgId":1583982,"Org":"合肥杰发科技有限公司","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·合肥市","广东省·深圳市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责芯片前端设计核心工作，涵盖架构方案设计、RTL代码编写与优化、功能验证等全流程环节，确保设计方案的可行性与先进性。\n2.深度参与芯片功能安全与信息安全设计工作，精准把控相关标准要求，推动芯片符合ISO 26262等功能安全标准及信息安全规范。\n3.牵头或协助完成Flash、HSM等关键模块的设计与开发工作，针对性优化模块性能、提升可靠性，满足芯片整体设计目标。\n4.负责Ethnet、DDR、USB、PCIE等高速接口的设计、调试与优化工作，保障接口数据传输的稳定性、高效性，解决设计过程中的技术难点。\n5.与后端设计、验证、测试等跨职能团队建立紧密协作机制，同步设计进展、协调解决项目推进中的跨部门问题，共同保障芯片项目按时按质完成开发与交付。\n6.负责撰写、整理芯片设计全流程相关技术文档，包括设计方案、技术规格书、验证报告等，对设计过程、关键决策及最终结果进行详细记录与总结。","Require":"1.教育背景：微电子、电子工程、计算机等相关专业硕士及以上学历。\n2.工作经验：具备6年以上芯片设计相关工作经验，拥有丰富的MCU设计经验，深入熟悉MCU架构及工作原理。\n3.专业能力：深入理解功能安全（如ISO 26262功能安全标准）和信息安全核心概念，具备相关项目实践经验者优先。\n4.技术经验：拥有Flash、HSM模块设计经验，熟悉其完整设计流程、技术要点及优化方法；具备Ethnet、DDR、USB、PCIE等高速接口设计与调试经验，深入了解相关协议及行业标准。\n5.工具技能：熟练掌握Verilog或VHDL等硬件描述语言，能够熟练使用各类EDA设计与验证工具，具备独立完成前端设计全流程工作的能力。\n6.综合素养：具备优秀的问题分析与解决能力，逻辑思维清晰；拥有良好的团队协作精神，沟通协调能力强；能够承受项目压力，高效推进工作，确保任务按时完成。\n7.学习创新：具备较强的自主学习能力和创新意识，对芯片设计领域前沿技术有浓厚兴趣，愿意持续投入学习与探索。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":" 杰发科技&武汉杰开","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-23T20:36:56","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"87d6de25-a3bd-44ef-b732-3c06e960fdc7","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561212906,"PostDateInt":1769171727000,"PostDate":"2026-01-23T20:35:27","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"芯片验证工程师(J12385)","OrgId":1583982,"Org":"合肥杰发科技有限公司","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·合肥市","广东省·深圳市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责开发仿真test bench并进行调试和优化，完成结果分析，覆盖率收集和分析；进行 testcase 的回归测试，注重自动化覆盖率提升，持续补充测试用例集。\n2、负责进行模块级、子系统级、系统级RTL前仿真，并根据需要进行门级网表后仿真、低功耗仿真验证、DFT仿真验证等工作。\n3、提交验证过程中发现的Bug，记录分析过程、持续和设计人员同步，追踪其解决，完整输出问题分析报告。\n4、完整输出仿真验证工作相关文档和报告。","Require":"1. 本科及以上，微电子 / 计算机 / 通信 / 电子信息等相关专业。\n2. 芯片行业 DV 验证工作，本科毕业工作 5 年、或者硕士毕业工作 3 年。\n3. 熟练使用 EDA 工具进行 DV 验证和调试。\n4. 掌握相关 DV 验证工作技能点，如 RTL 仿真、后仿真、低功耗仿真、断言、形式化验证等技能。\n5. 熟练使用一种或多种 DV 验证脚本语言进行流程开发，提升验证效率，如 Perl/Python/Tcl/Shell/Makefile。\n6. 熟悉 DV 验证流程 / 规范，如需求分析 / 环境搭建 /case 创建 / 验证文档整理；保证验证工作的完整性和质量。\n7. 熟知车规级功能安全标准者优先，能读英文技术资料，沟通协作佳，工作严谨。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":" 杰发科技&武汉杰开","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-23T20:35:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"62e45b93-ce7f-4a14-a2cc-11c8e85c1889","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561212905,"PostDateInt":1769171629000,"PostDate":"2026-01-23T20:33:49","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"模拟验证工程师(J12384)","OrgId":1583982,"Org":"合肥杰发科技有限公司","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·合肥市","广东省·深圳市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、协同车规芯片研发团队，依产品规格确定模拟验证指标与可测性设计需求，编写并执行模拟模块（如 LDO、XOSC 等）验证方案。\n2、开发芯片端验证代码，测试模块参数。开发自动化工具，编写测试机程序、高低温自动化测试上位机程序、PC 端上位机工具，用 python 脚本处理批量验证数据。\n3、分析验证数据，为芯片性能优化提供依据。整理开发资料与文档，促进团队信息流通。\n4、为硬件设计、软件开发等跨部门团队提供模拟验证技术支持，保障产品全生命周期技术连贯。","Require":"1、本科及以上，电子信息等相关专业。\n2、具备5 年以上芯片验证测试程序开发经验，3 年以上模拟验证及自动化工具开发经验，有车规芯片项目经验优先。\n3、熟悉集成电路模拟验证测试原理、方法及电路电气参数特性，熟练运用 C、C++ 及 python 语言\n3、具备批量数据脚本开发能力，熟悉 Chroma 3380 等 ATE 测试平台操作，了解车规级芯片开发流程与行业标准及模拟电路设计。\n4、善于分析解决技术难题，沟通协作能力强，学习能力佳，工作尽责，注重开发与验证质量。\n5、适应出差，具备英文读写能力。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":" 杰发科技&武汉杰开","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-23T20:33:49","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"2b7111a7-9025-46a4-ac81-f3a573795a99","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561212902,"PostDateInt":1769171449000,"PostDate":"2026-01-23T20:30:49","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"底软开发工程师(J12383)","OrgId":1584157,"Org":"技术平台部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·合肥市","广东省·深圳市","上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、基于车规芯片需求，移植 ARM 内核系统，优化 MCU 在车载场景的性能，确保系统高效稳定运行。\n2、负责 HSM 选型、集成与开发，制定并落实安全方案，保障芯片数据安全，抵御网络攻击。\n3、主导 AAH 从需求分析到代码实现的开发，确保其符合车规安全标准，与 MCU 产品深度融合。\n4、协同多部门，提供底软技术支持，保障产品全生命周期技术连贯、稳定，确保底软与产品架构无缝对接。\n5、编写开发设计、接口说明、测试报告等技术文档，为产品维护、升级提供资料。","Require":"1、本科及以上，电子信息等相关专业。\n2、具备5 年以上车规芯片底软开发经验，2 年以上 ARM CPU、HSM 或 AAH 开发经验。有车规底软项目主导经验优先。\n3、需精通 ARM CPU 架构、系统移植与性能优化，理解 HSM 原理，掌握加密算法、安全协议及 HSM 开发，具备 AAH 开发能力，熟悉车规信息安全标准，掌握 C/C++ 语言与开发、调试工具，了解硬件电路知识。\n4、善于分析解决技术难题，沟通协调能力佳，学习能力强，工作尽责，注重开发质量与进度。\n5、适应出差，具备英文读写能力，可阅读英文技术资料 。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":" 杰发科技&武汉杰开","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-23T20:30:49","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"bffe9f35-a574-435c-b84d-a6fa463001f5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561212901,"PostDateInt":1769171348000,"PostDate":"2026-01-23T20:29:08","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"底软MCU信息安全经理(J12382)","OrgId":1584157,"Org":"技术平台部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","广东省·深圳市","安徽省·合肥市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、依据车规安全需求，规划并主导 Crypto MCAL 开发。制定计划，组织团队完成设计、编码、测试，确保开发合规，提升产品加密与安全通信性能。\n2、审核客户产品软件网络安全资料流程，确保资料完整合规，符合车规信息安全要求。与客户沟通，提供指导，推动项目进展。\n3、定期评估现有安全方案，结合新技术、新漏洞提出优化建议并落实，完善产品安全防护体系。\n4、协同硬件、软件开发